# Call the Spirit Dragons: "If you put +1/+1 counters on five Dragons this way, you win the game." Changelings are Dragons, so the five
# single-color ones - Flock Impostor (white), Sizzling Changeling (red), Mutable Explorer (green), Graveshifter (black), Traxos,
# Academy Guardian (blue) - are cast one a turn (T3 to T11), each upkeep from T5 putting counters on those out, one Dragon to a color
# so nothing is asked. At Bot1's T13 upkeep all five colors find a different Dragon and Bot1 wins.

